mentions.description:
Thank you for watching 🕊️

I know so many beekeepers who are simply in love with their plastic frames, but I want to raise my concern that, usually, hives are lying in direct sunlight, and not even that much extreme heat can cause those frames to mildly melt, and that will release lots of microplastics, which will eventually end up in your honey supply

